WEBVTT

00:00:01.397 --> 00:00:03.482
You've lost contact with Metal Bat?

00:00:03.649 --> 00:00:04.567
Yes.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.237
I've already called for backup
from Class A heroes and above.

00:00:10.239 --> 00:00:12.450
Centichoro,
the gigantic bug-monster...

00:00:12.742 --> 00:00:14.243
Threat Level: Dragon.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.037
Practically a natural disaster.

00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:18.414
This far exceeds what happened
two years ago...

00:00:18.622 --> 00:00:21.584
We may not have
the numbers to defeat it.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:24.003
King is occupied
fighting something else,

00:00:24.378 --> 00:00:26.172
but what of the other
Class S heroes?

00:00:28.257 --> 00:00:30.259
Multiple emergency calls
from all over.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.471
W-What's happening?

00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:35.681
D-Damn...

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.641
It's got us cornered!

00:00:38.225 --> 00:00:40.936
If we don't do something,
he's got us!

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.271
Wait!

00:00:46.025 --> 00:00:49.695
CLASS S, RANK 6
METAL KNIGHT

00:00:54.158 --> 00:00:55.618
We're gonna be okay!

00:00:57.453 --> 00:00:58.454
You're in the way.

00:00:59.205 --> 00:01:01.082
A weapons test
is not some spectacle.

00:01:01.165 --> 00:01:02.458
Move off now!

00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:03.918
— S-Sorry, sir!
— S-Sorry, sir!

00:01:04.293 --> 00:01:05.461
Not a scratch...

00:01:05.628 --> 00:01:08.339
For a biologic, its armor is
remarkably resistant.

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:11.592
Irksome insect!

00:01:12.218 --> 00:01:14.011
Is that thing still after us?

00:01:15.137 --> 00:01:16.639
I think we managed to lose it.

00:01:17.014 --> 00:01:19.475
I wonder if Metal Bat's all right.

00:01:22.269 --> 00:01:24.772
You thought
you'd gotten away, heroes?

00:01:25.147 --> 00:01:26.649
Leave those two with us.

00:01:26.941 --> 00:01:27.650
— Monsters?!
— Monsters?!

00:01:29.443 --> 00:01:30.569
Let's see...

00:01:30.653 --> 00:01:34.448
The report said Metal Bat
was taking on Centichoro.

00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:37.451
Where is he and what's he doing?

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.745
This is unprecedented.

00:01:40.496 --> 00:01:42.915
Monsters of threat level Demon
and above

00:01:42.998 --> 00:01:46.669
are appearing simultaneously
in every city!

00:01:47.837 --> 00:01:50.381
Our response teams
are being overwhelmed...

00:02:06.021 --> 00:02:08.023
Through the once tranquil town

00:02:08.149 --> 00:02:10.442
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:02:10.526 --> 00:02:14.363
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:02:15.281 --> 00:02:17.366
Who 1s going to take the lead

00:02:17.491 --> 00:02:19.869
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:02:20.077 --> 00:02:24.832
Destruction, Contusion...
Loosen up!

00:02:24.915 --> 00:02:26.876
We know, We are...

00:02:27.001 --> 00:02:29.587
HEROES!

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.297
Why were you

00:02:31.422 --> 00:02:33.591
born of evil?

00:02:33.716 --> 00:02:35.676
If you wish to know

00:02:35.801 --> 00:02:38.053
I shall tell!

00:02:38.179 --> 00:02:44.059
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:02:44.226 --> 00:02:47.563
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:02:48.856 --> 00:02:53.402
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:02:53.569 --> 00:02:58.073
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:02:58.157 --> 00:03:02.703
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:03:02.828 --> 00:03:08.918
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:03:09.001 --> 00:03:12.379
He must fight!

00:03:25.142 --> 00:03:30.272
THE MARTIAL ARTS
TOURNAMENT

00:03:30.314 --> 00:03:32.316
but this'll be over quick.

00:03:32.942 --> 00:03:34.401
Shut it!

00:03:42.993 --> 00:03:44.328
You've lost so much blood,

00:03:44.453 --> 00:03:46.538
you're barely able to
stay conscious.

00:03:47.331 --> 00:03:49.458
Plus, a bunch of your bones
are broken.

00:03:50.793 --> 00:03:52.920
What keeps you standing?
Hero pride?

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.477
The swings are coming taster?

00:04:11.063 --> 00:04:12.398
More powertul, too...

00:04:13.023 --> 00:04:14.441
That shouldnt be possible...

00:04:17.695 --> 00:04:19.488
But there's no doubt about it...

00:04:25.703 --> 00:04:27.204
With every hit he takes,

00:04:27.413 --> 00:04:30.374
every time he gets hurt,
he becomes physically stronger.

00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:32.751
How do you even make sense?

00:04:32.918 --> 00:04:34.545
Screw makin' sense.

00:04:34.795 --> 00:04:36.422
It's about fighting spirit!

00:04:37.006 --> 00:04:38.173
What the hell?

00:04:38.632 --> 00:04:40.926
Let's get it on, "hero hunter."

00:04:41.343 --> 00:04:44.513
I still got a giant centipede
to take care of!

00:04:44.847 --> 00:04:46.181
He isn't done... ?

00:04:47.182 --> 00:04:49.560
And how long's that
"fighting spirit" gonna last?

00:04:50.185 --> 00:04:52.187
I'll play your game.

00:05:01.196 --> 00:05:02.197
Over here!

00:05:03.198 --> 00:05:04.158
Idiot!

00:05:04.992 --> 00:05:08.620
I got a rule never to let muggers
or hero hunters slide!

00:05:09.371 --> 00:05:13.375
I'll pound that rotten spirit
of yours into shape!

00:05:15.085 --> 00:05:17.421
Missed me, stupid!

00:05:19.715 --> 00:05:23.385
You plan on swinging that thing
around till you're dead?

00:05:23.844 --> 00:05:25.095
Until I'm dead?

00:05:25.596 --> 00:05:27.431
Hell no...

00:05:27.973 --> 00:05:29.183
Only till I win!

00:05:32.353 --> 00:05:33.312
Killer Move!

00:05:33.645 --> 00:05:35.647
Fighting Spirit Brutal Tornado!

00:05:35.689 --> 00:05:36.607
BRUTAL TORNADO

00:05:37.691 --> 00:05:39.777
You're just spinning around.

00:05:39.902 --> 00:05:40.986
Don't make me laugh.

00:05:44.239 --> 00:05:45.282
Too bad for you,

00:05:45.824 --> 00:05:48.911
but parrying amateur attacks
like yours is kid stuff.

00:06:03.217 --> 00:06:05.427
Hmph. Finally down, eh?

00:06:05.761 --> 00:06:09.139
Both Tank-top Master and Metal Bat
were nothing but brutes.

00:06:09.515 --> 00:06:13.519
Against a human martial artist
they have no answer.

00:06:14.061 --> 00:06:17.272
Taking the Hero Association down
might be easier than I thought.

00:06:18.899 --> 00:06:20.109
What's this?!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.613
Could that goon really have
so much power?

00:06:26.156 --> 00:06:28.700
If he'd caught me square,
I'd have been in trouble.

00:06:28.951 --> 00:06:29.910
Big Bro!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.459
Big Brother Bat.

00:06:38.877 --> 00:06:39.628
Tch.

00:06:39.711 --> 00:06:42.548
What's going on?
Who is that man?

00:06:43.215 --> 00:06:44.216
Your kid sister?

00:06:44.299 --> 00:06:45.843
Zenko! Stay ba—

00:06:46.468 --> 00:06:47.136
Big bro!

00:06:47.553 --> 00:06:49.888
You let your best chance slip by.

00:06:50.055 --> 00:06:53.475
Now it's time to put you
out of your misery!

00:06:54.393 --> 00:06:55.352
No!

00:06:55.477 --> 00:06:59.148
My brother promised no violence
when I'm around.

00:06:59.481 --> 00:07:00.858
So no fighting allowed!

00:07:02.359 --> 00:07:02.860
Huh?

00:07:02.985 --> 00:07:04.153
The fight's over!

00:07:05.154 --> 00:07:08.699
Why do I have to follow
your family's rule?

00:07:10.284 --> 00:07:11.326
It's over!

00:07:15.998 --> 00:07:19.126
Oh right, I did have something else
I was doing.

00:07:19.793 --> 00:07:23.255
No time to waste on a jackass.

00:07:23.964 --> 00:07:26.175
You started this fight, bastard.

00:07:26.717 --> 00:07:29.178
You get to live for now, Metal Bat.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:30.012
What?!

00:07:30.095 --> 00:07:32.514
Big Bro, never mind him.
Let's go home!

00:07:32.848 --> 00:07:33.974
There's a monster here.

00:07:34.224 --> 00:07:35.184
Oh yeah!

00:07:35.851 --> 00:07:38.645
That man and his son are in danger.
I gotta go.

00:07:38.812 --> 00:07:40.230
You're kidding, right?!

00:07:40.355 --> 00:07:42.441
Hold it! You can't go!

00:07:42.733 --> 00:07:44.193
You'll get killed!

00:07:44.568 --> 00:07:46.528
Go on home, Zenko.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.447
You're such a hard-head!

00:07:52.201 --> 00:07:54.328
Big Bro? Hello?

00:07:57.206 --> 00:08:01.210
Mmmm...so that's the hero hunter
from the rumors?

00:08:02.794 --> 00:08:04.546
He's pretty good for a human.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.758
Bah, he didn't even finish
the hero off.

00:08:07.883 --> 00:08:12.387
No, that man could be put to
good use, my dear Hedro-jellyfish.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.354
Metal Bat's younger sister...

00:08:20.562 --> 00:08:23.023
Never can have enough hostages!

00:08:26.485 --> 00:08:29.571
So the eyes I've felt watching me
were yours.

00:08:30.781 --> 00:08:32.115
You survived that?!

00:08:32.241 --> 00:08:33.450
Hold, hero hunter!

00:08:34.076 --> 00:08:35.410
Two against one, eh?

00:08:35.494 --> 00:08:37.120
We are not your enemies.

00:08:37.287 --> 00:08:40.123
Take a look at this.
I'm sure you'll be interested.

00:08:41.166 --> 00:08:42.543
"Monster Association"?

00:08:42.709 --> 00:08:44.086
I thought he'd bite!

00:08:45.128 --> 00:08:48.757
Why not come with us?
We shall escort you to our hideout.

00:08:51.927 --> 00:08:53.428
Not interested. Screw off.

00:08:55.722 --> 00:08:58.267
I'll pretend I didn't see that.

00:08:58.392 --> 00:09:01.186
But one day soon,
we Wi// meet again.

00:09:01.603 --> 00:09:05.732
Should you continue
hunting heroes, that is.

00:09:05.941 --> 00:09:07.276
We'll be watching you!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.323
Creeps.

00:09:13.949 --> 00:09:15.701
Talk about disappointment...

00:09:16.827 --> 00:09:18.412
My Mohi-Punch had no effect?

00:09:18.579 --> 00:09:19.830
My Pine Cannon neither...

00:09:20.038 --> 00:09:25.294
SMASH

00:09:26.044 --> 00:09:28.547
You're both so weak,
I can't even think of a joke!

00:09:29.464 --> 00:09:31.300
Do you have any frickin' idea

00:09:31.425 --> 00:09:33.885
how hard I've trained
this horn and body

00:09:33.969 --> 00:09:35.721
for the day of the final battle?

00:09:35.804 --> 00:09:37.347
Any idea at all?!

00:09:37.556 --> 00:09:38.515
Rhino-wrestler!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:39.933
Bring the hostages!

00:09:40.309 --> 00:09:41.602
We're pulling out!

00:09:41.685 --> 00:09:44.896
What? Aren't we taking the fight
to Metal Knight?

00:09:45.063 --> 00:09:48.650
No. That thing's nothing but
a remote-controlled drone.

00:09:49.151 --> 00:09:51.320
Besides, today is not
the final battle.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.614
You're not to go off
on your own.

00:09:53.822 --> 00:09:54.990
Very well.

00:09:55.073 --> 00:09:57.409
Do I take both of these creatures?

00:09:57.618 --> 00:09:59.661
No, just the child will do.

00:09:59.786 --> 00:10:00.829
Stop this!

00:10:00.954 --> 00:10:03.498
Dammit!
We can't let Metal Bat down!

00:10:03.624 --> 00:10:05.292
You'll have to kill us first!

00:10:05.792 --> 00:10:07.336
Then die!

00:10:09.212 --> 00:10:10.881
Did you see that, Phoenix Man?

00:10:11.173 --> 00:10:14.343
What threat level are they
gonna give me?

00:10:14.509 --> 00:10:15.344
Who knows?

00:10:15.469 --> 00:10:18.096
Centichoro!
Our mission is accomplished!

00:10:18.805 --> 00:10:20.349
Time to withdraw!

00:10:20.641 --> 00:10:21.642
Gah!

00:10:28.774 --> 00:10:31.109
Escaping underground?
You won't get away!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.279
I'm not letting go!

00:10:37.532 --> 00:10:40.202
We've done enough.
The final battle is yet to come.

00:10:41.828 --> 00:10:42.829
Kill it!

00:10:43.205 --> 00:10:44.581
Keep it up, Heavy Kong!

00:10:45.415 --> 00:10:47.459
Darn, still no backup...

00:10:47.542 --> 00:10:48.877
Where the devil are they?

00:10:49.002 --> 00:10:50.545
You a Class A hero?

00:10:51.463 --> 00:10:53.465
How many Class A scalps
will it take

00:10:53.548 --> 00:10:55.342
to raise my threat level?

00:10:57.803 --> 00:10:59.721
This monster's immune
to my stun rods...

00:10:59.888 --> 00:11:02.391
I'm a poor match up.
My luck's bad today.

00:11:02.516 --> 00:11:04.851
Class A hero, Lightning Genji.

00:11:05.352 --> 00:11:07.396
That's not at all so.
Your luck is good!

00:11:07.854 --> 00:11:11.692
You see, other cities are facing
far more violent monsters.

00:11:15.904 --> 00:11:20.659
What in heaven's name
is happening?!

00:11:20.742 --> 00:11:23.245
You're the only one
still sitting on his ass!

00:11:23.328 --> 00:11:24.746
It's go time, doofus!

00:11:24.871 --> 00:11:26.331
Hurry it up! Charanko!

00:11:27.874 --> 00:11:28.834
All right.

00:11:28.959 --> 00:11:29.918
Guess I'll go.

00:11:31.294 --> 00:11:32.796
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:11:32.921 --> 00:11:34.756
we have kept you waiting
long enough!

00:11:35.173 --> 00:11:39.428
The competitors for Super Fight 22
are now entering the arena!

00:11:43.849 --> 00:11:45.434
First up, a first-time contestant!

00:11:45.517 --> 00:11:48.937
The Class A, Rank 19 hero
Known as "Lightning Max,"

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.857
of the fighting style
"Hyper Karate Max"!

00:11:52.107 --> 00:11:53.525
Got my eyes on the prize.

00:11:54.067 --> 00:11:57.738
Our sole female fighter,
with lightning-fast attacks:

00:11:57.821 --> 00:11:59.448
Ring-Ring,
with her "Palm Bells Fist"!

00:11:59.573 --> 00:12:00.824
Let's start already.

00:12:01.324 --> 00:12:03.535
Next, Benpats
of "The Way of the Cruel" School.

00:12:03.618 --> 00:12:05.454
Plus the perennial
top-four competitor,

00:12:05.537 --> 00:12:08.749
whose slithery arms can
strike opponents anywhere,

00:12:08.999 --> 00:12:11.042
Class A's lowest-ranked hero,

00:12:11.126 --> 00:12:12.627
Snakebite Snek!

00:12:12.836 --> 00:12:14.963
Did he have to say
"lowest-ranked"?

00:12:15.338 --> 00:12:17.340
There are many more folks!

00:12:17.466 --> 00:12:20.469
With his super-conductor body,
Boltane of the "Fist of Thunder"!

00:12:20.635 --> 00:12:22.763
Bazuzu, master of
"Bazuzu's Nuclear Fist"!

00:12:22.846 --> 00:12:24.973
Gatling of the "Many Fists" style!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:28.477
From the Sunflower Dojo, Hamukichi
and his "Gentle Self Defense"!

00:12:28.727 --> 00:12:31.146
Dave with his "Giant Smothering
Killing Technique"!

00:12:31.396 --> 00:12:33.690
Logy, master of
Psycho-analytic Martial Arts!

00:12:34.191 --> 00:12:35.567
Mentai of the "Spice Fist" school!

00:12:35.859 --> 00:12:37.486
Jakumen,
the "Giga-Pro" wrestler!

00:12:38.069 --> 00:12:40.530
Choze
of the "Chosen One Way"!

00:12:40.822 --> 00:12:43.992
Formerly of the "Fist of Flowing Water
Crushing Rock,"

00:12:44.075 --> 00:12:46.369
Sourface, master of
Sourface Kempo!

00:12:46.495 --> 00:12:47.829
I'm so tense, I might barf...

00:12:48.663 --> 00:12:50.207
On his seventh straight appearance,

00:12:50.332 --> 00:12:53.293
will the man who won't quit
win his first fight?

00:12:53.543 --> 00:12:55.712
Zakkos of
the "Take-the-Plunge True Fist"!

00:12:55.837 --> 00:12:58.423
I'll get my first win
and propose to my girl.

00:12:58.715 --> 00:12:59.883
Moving on...

00:13:00.008 --> 00:13:02.511
The man who wrote
"Please don't aim for my head"

00:13:02.594 --> 00:13:03.762
on his registration...

00:13:04.012 --> 00:13:05.847
Is he really here to fight?

00:13:06.348 --> 00:13:08.683
Charanko with his "Fist of
Seltzer Water on the Rocks."

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.020
Why are they already booing?

00:13:12.229 --> 00:13:14.189
Isn't that Genos from Class S?

00:13:14.606 --> 00:13:16.191
He's a fight fan...?

00:13:16.316 --> 00:13:19.069
Some say
he's the greatest contender ever,

00:13:19.194 --> 00:13:21.363
with two past championships...

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.366
Every one of his fights
has been lopsided.

00:13:24.574 --> 00:13:27.536
But the man himself says
he's never gotten serious!

00:13:27.828 --> 00:13:30.080
Bakuzan, master of
the "Dark Hell Killing Jutsu"!

00:13:30.705 --> 00:13:33.792
Winning the championship today
will have true meaning.

00:13:33.875 --> 00:13:37.128
And now, a man who boasts
unparalleled strength.

00:13:37.379 --> 00:13:39.548
Appearing after skipping
the past seven tournaments!

00:13:39.798 --> 00:13:42.634
A four-time past champion
and a legend in his own time,

00:13:42.801 --> 00:13:44.719
Suiryu, master of
"Dark Corporeal Fist"!

00:13:45.053 --> 00:13:46.179
All right!

00:13:47.389 --> 00:13:50.225
He's been gallivanting about
the past three years

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.561
and says the prize money
is his only objective!

00:13:53.103 --> 00:13:55.522
Could his power derive from
not clinging to glory?

00:13:55.605 --> 00:13:59.401
But this time, Bakuzan is also
in the competition!

00:13:59.609 --> 00:14:01.027
So that's Suiryu...

00:14:01.152 --> 00:14:04.614
If I kill him, I'll truly be
the strongest active fighter.

00:14:06.324 --> 00:14:07.868
I sense his piercing aura...

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.789
But the one I wanted to face
Is the last tournament's champion.

00:14:17.502 --> 00:14:18.461
If lm gonna fight,

00:14:18.587 --> 00:14:21.006
at least it could have been
against someone tough.

00:14:21.131 --> 00:14:23.383
These are your 18 contestants.

00:14:23.508 --> 00:14:27.012
Let Super Fight 22 begin!

00:14:29.973 --> 00:14:31.433
Deep breaths, deep breaths...

00:14:31.558 --> 00:14:33.768
I'm okay. I'm okay. I'm okay.

00:14:33.894 --> 00:14:35.854
Hey, old dude, nervous?

00:14:35.937 --> 00:14:37.063
Don't call me "old dude"!

00:14:37.272 --> 00:14:39.482
I may outrank you at the dojo,
but I'm 20, same as you!

00:14:39.941 --> 00:14:41.401
He's younger than me?

00:14:41.484 --> 00:14:42.485
Hey, you!

00:14:42.903 --> 00:14:45.030
You claim a style
no one's heard of.

00:14:45.196 --> 00:14:46.448
I smell an amateur.

00:14:46.865 --> 00:14:49.534
Martial arts isn't for fools.
Withdraw now.

00:14:50.118 --> 00:14:52.162
Else I'll crush you without mercy.

00:14:52.829 --> 00:14:53.788
No response?

00:14:53.955 --> 00:14:55.415
It's you he's talking to!

00:14:55.498 --> 00:14:58.001
You can't even tie your belt right.

00:14:58.251 --> 00:14:59.961
Haven't you learned anything?

00:15:00.378 --> 00:15:01.421
You're hopeless.

00:15:01.796 --> 00:15:04.799
Super Fight is the pinnacle
of mixed martial arts.

00:15:05.133 --> 00:15:07.344
It's not some playground
for amateurs.

00:15:07.886 --> 00:15:10.388
He's a student of Fist of
Flowing Water Crushing Rock.

00:15:10.472 --> 00:15:11.473
Him?!

00:15:11.723 --> 00:15:14.851
I see...
How the standards have fallen.

00:15:14.976 --> 00:15:15.810
What's that?!

00:15:16.144 --> 00:15:20.398
Bang was slated to be
chief judge today,

00:15:20.857 --> 00:15:23.193
but he cancelled last minute,
causing all kinds of trouble.

00:15:23.818 --> 00:15:24.986
Master Bang did?!

00:15:25.111 --> 00:15:26.780
The "treasure of
the martial arts world"

00:15:26.863 --> 00:15:28.823
ditched his dojo and disciples

00:15:29.032 --> 00:15:31.493
so he could run off
and play "hero."

00:15:31.576 --> 00:15:32.953
I won't stand for this!

00:15:33.161 --> 00:15:35.038
And why aren't you angry?!

00:15:35.705 --> 00:15:39.250
I quit, but you stayed on
as his last student!

00:15:39.668 --> 00:15:40.669
Oh, I see...

00:15:40.919 --> 00:15:42.879
Well, it's okay.
Let him have his say.

00:15:43.338 --> 00:15:44.297
What?!

00:15:44.798 --> 00:15:46.508
I didn't come to argue.

00:15:46.883 --> 00:15:48.677
He says he's gonna crush me.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.345
Sounds like fun.

00:15:51.388 --> 00:15:52.889
He seems kinda weak, though.

00:15:53.181 --> 00:15:55.183
Heh, that's telling him, Charanko!

00:15:56.017 --> 00:15:58.228
I'm gonna butcher you
like a butcher!

00:15:59.187 --> 00:16:01.523
I don't mind being on Garou's trail...

00:16:01.856 --> 00:16:03.775
but you're sure
he'll simply show up?

00:16:05.193 --> 00:16:08.196
Tch! He's certainly in a mood...

00:16:10.573 --> 00:16:14.494
Something's after the Class A
we've been shadowing.

00:16:14.577 --> 00:16:16.454
What?! Let's move!

00:16:19.374 --> 00:16:22.502
The Demonic Pugilist is here
to raze this city!

00:16:22.711 --> 00:16:24.421
It's not Garou, after alll.

00:16:25.755 --> 00:16:27.924
You sit this one out, Bomb.

00:16:28.675 --> 00:16:30.051
Silverfang?

00:16:30.135 --> 00:16:33.680
Great timing.
We can work together to...huh?

00:16:34.222 --> 00:16:36.224
You're a Class S hero, aren't you?

00:16:36.349 --> 00:16:39.019
I know you. You're that
renowned martial artist.

00:16:39.394 --> 00:16:41.896
When I was human,
I was a martial artist myself.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.774
But sanctioned bouts
weren't enough!

00:16:45.066 --> 00:16:45.442
That's right.

00:16:45.567 --> 00:16:49.696
My uncontrollable urge to rampage
turned me into a monster!

00:16:54.117 --> 00:16:55.702
Whoa...

00:16:58.788 --> 00:17:02.542
We must find him.
Before he ends up like this.

00:17:05.045 --> 00:17:07.589
All right!
It's time for our first match!

00:17:07.964 --> 00:17:09.507
Max vs. Ring-Ring!

00:17:09.632 --> 00:17:10.091
Begin!

00:17:11.551 --> 00:17:13.011
Ring-Ring takes the offensive!

00:17:13.094 --> 00:17:16.264
Heart Hard Hit!

00:17:19.684 --> 00:17:21.519
A whip can generate
that much power?!

00:17:22.896 --> 00:17:25.732
You're a hundred years too young...

00:17:25.899 --> 00:17:27.650
...to come at Super S head on!

00:17:28.151 --> 00:17:30.779
You pathetic, worthless hero pigs!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:34.866
Heavy Kong...

00:17:34.949 --> 00:17:37.118
This the best Class A can offer?

00:17:37.285 --> 00:17:38.995
They sure don't have much fight...

00:17:39.412 --> 00:17:42.373
Anyway, you all spread the word.

00:17:42.665 --> 00:17:45.460
The one who took down Heavy Kong

00:17:45.668 --> 00:17:48.004
was me, the great Marshal Gorilla.

00:17:57.847 --> 00:17:59.099
This Is going nowhere!

00:17:59.974 --> 00:18:01.309
You won't escape.

00:18:09.484 --> 00:18:11.528
I just couldn't win. ...!

00:18:12.612 --> 00:18:13.655
Interesting...

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.825
With the right match up,
even threat level Tigers like us

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:19.327
can defeat Class A heroes.

00:18:20.829 --> 00:18:23.873
Perhaps there was no need
for us to hide away.

00:18:24.332 --> 00:18:27.127
We have word that Heavy Kong
was defeated in City W.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:31.256
We haven't been able to raise
Metal Bat or Metal Knight on comms.

00:18:31.673 --> 00:18:33.508
The mammoth creature in City I

00:18:33.633 --> 00:18:35.468
is growing in size
as it devours buildings.

00:18:35.844 --> 00:18:39.055
It's also ossifying!
We cannot let it continue!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.140
Toxins!

00:18:40.223 --> 00:18:42.392
The monster in City Y
is using a neurotoxin

00:18:42.517 --> 00:18:44.519
to paralyze the heroes!

00:18:45.019 --> 00:18:47.355
It's no use.
There are too many of them.

00:18:48.356 --> 00:18:50.608
If this goes on,
we'll be wiped out!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.778
Both our side and the humans

00:18:53.945 --> 00:18:56.739
appear to have misjudged
our relative abilities.

00:18:57.365 --> 00:19:00.076
We were stronger than we thought,

00:19:00.493 --> 00:19:04.873
and the humans were weaker
than they thought.

00:19:06.666 --> 00:19:08.543
Stop... Snap out of it!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.254
What's wrong with you,
Darkness Blade?!

00:19:11.546 --> 00:19:13.715
When I punish someone with my whip,

00:19:13.798 --> 00:19:17.093
it imparts a special stimulus
that turns them into love slaves.

00:19:17.218 --> 00:19:19.053
Stop this...!

00:19:19.637 --> 00:19:21.723
If you desire my love,

00:19:21.806 --> 00:19:23.683
you will fight to your deaths!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.398
Are you guys...?

00:19:30.481 --> 00:19:31.399
My, my...

00:19:31.524 --> 00:19:34.569
More suitors come to vie
for my affection.

00:19:35.153 --> 00:19:37.155
How titillating!

00:19:41.951 --> 00:19:44.204
That's all it takes to be
threat level Demon?

00:19:44.287 --> 00:19:45.914
Not a bad wager.

00:19:46.456 --> 00:19:49.500
If I defeat you, their minds might
be freed from your control.

00:19:49.959 --> 00:19:53.254
Then they'll be in my debt.
Two birds with one stone.

00:19:54.088 --> 00:19:55.590
I knew it! The Blizzard Group!

00:19:56.132 --> 00:19:57.800
You can't escape us.

00:19:58.259 --> 00:20:01.846
Oh, I wish you wouldn't toy with
my sadistic instincts.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.307
I might get worked up
and kill you too quickly.

00:20:04.557 --> 00:20:09.270
Quite the easy KO for Max
against Ring-Ring!

00:20:09.646 --> 00:20:13.483
Talk was that his fighting prowess
was suspect.

00:20:13.608 --> 00:20:16.069
Yet despite his low seed,

00:20:16.152 --> 00:20:19.614
he advances uninjured and with ease
past his lady opponent!

00:20:20.073 --> 00:20:22.075
I wouldn't say uninjured...

00:20:22.784 --> 00:20:25.912
He managed to win without using
the gunpowder in his shoes.

00:20:26.287 --> 00:20:28.456
What's a "low seed"?

00:20:28.581 --> 00:20:31.376
Those who are considered
less capable

00:20:31.668 --> 00:20:35.421
are placed in a position that's
more difficult to win it all.

00:20:35.546 --> 00:20:36.506
I see...

00:20:36.714 --> 00:20:40.134
So he was considered weaker
than others.

00:20:40.385 --> 00:20:43.179
Those who leave martial arts
to become heroes

00:20:43.304 --> 00:20:46.724
are often viewed as having taken
the easy way out.

00:20:47.141 --> 00:20:48.017
What about Bang?

00:20:48.142 --> 00:20:49.686
Master Bang is unique.

00:20:49.978 --> 00:20:52.814
And don't forget
you're a low seed yourself, Charanko!

00:20:53.147 --> 00:20:54.941
What? Oh, you're right.

00:20:55.984 --> 00:20:58.611
So the two in the corners
aren't the strongest...

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.655
They just think I'm weak.

00:21:00.822 --> 00:21:03.574
No, those two are definitely
very strong.

00:21:03.783 --> 00:21:04.784
After I fight you,

00:21:04.867 --> 00:21:07.120
I'll face Bakuzan,
a championship contender.

00:21:07.412 --> 00:21:08.329
Uh...

00:21:08.454 --> 00:21:11.874
According to these brackets...oh!
You're a pushover too.

00:21:12.834 --> 00:21:15.086
Our second bout,
Zakkos vs. Charanko,

00:21:15.169 --> 00:21:16.337
is about to begin!

00:21:16.629 --> 00:21:18.256
Youre so dead!

00:21:29.434 --> 00:21:34.439
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:21:34.522 --> 00:21:39.235
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:21:39.736 --> 00:21:45.241
Will the future call
or Will it slip away?

00:21:45.366 --> 00:21:50.204
There's just so much
that we dont know

00:21:50.455 --> 00:21:55.752
But one day, well make peace
within ourselves

00:21:56.002 --> 00:22:01.424
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:01.507 --> 00:22:06.596
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:22:06.721 --> 00:22:10.725
That's what we are to each other

00:22:10.767 --> 00:22:17.065
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:22:17.231 --> 00:22:21.611
That kindness Is the true strength

00:22:21.694 --> 00:22:28.076
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:22:28.159 --> 00:22:33.414
So I promise that lil come back

00:22:33.539 --> 00:22:39.337
I promise that I'll come back to you

00:22:51.057 --> 00:22:53.559
Holy crap! Charanko can hit!

00:22:53.643 --> 00:22:57.188
Could Zakkos be concussed
with a single slap?

00:22:57.271 --> 00:23:00.483
Or is this less about
Charanko being strong, as...

00:23:00.817 --> 00:23:03.820
He's weak!
Zakkos is some weak sauce!

00:23:04.028 --> 00:23:07.240
He even invited his girlfriend,
intending to propose today,

00:23:07.323 --> 00:23:11.244
but now, all his life plans have
gone terribly awry!

00:23:11.953 --> 00:23:14.122
Oops. I did a bad thing.

00:23:14.622 --> 00:23:17.291
I have new information.

00:23:17.375 --> 00:23:19.585
Wait, it seems his girlfriend
didn't show up!

00:23:19.794 --> 00:23:21.462
Safe! He's safe!

00:23:22.255 --> 00:23:24.132
That's good.

00:23:24.382 --> 00:23:26.300
Nothing good about it.

00:23:26.968 --> 00:23:28.469
The expected outcome.

00:23:29.554 --> 00:23:31.222
At this rate,
the tournament will end

00:23:31.305 --> 00:23:34.559
With Master never tasting
true martial arts.

00:23:38.354 --> 00:23:40.481
Zakkos's moves weren't that bad...

00:23:41.065 --> 00:23:44.402
Guess I know who I'll be facing
in the finals.

00:23:45.611 --> 00:23:50.366
THE MONSTER UPRISING
